":\"$undefined\",\"unauthorized\":\"$undefined\"}]]}],{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"error\":\"$undefined\",\"errorStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"errorScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{}],\"templateStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"templateScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"notFound\":\"$undefined\",\"forbidden\":\"$undefined\",\"unauthorized\":\"$undefined\"}]]}],{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"error\":\"$undefined\",\"errorStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"errorScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{}],\"templateStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"templateScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"notFound\":\"$undefined\",\"forbidden\":\"$undefined\",\"unauthorized\":\"$undefined\"}]]}],{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[\"$L4\",[[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/0xv9uz7g8af6d.js\",\"async\":true,\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]],[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$6\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@7\"}]}]]}],{},null,false,null]},null,false,\"$@8\"]},null,false,\"$@8\"]},null,false,\"$@8\"]},null,false,null],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L9\",null,{\"children\":\"$La\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$Lb\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$6\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":\"$Lc\"}]}]}],[\"$\",\"meta\",null,{\"name\":\"next-size-adjust\",\"content\":\"\"}]]}],false]],\"m\":\"$undefined\",\"G\":[\"$d\",[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/0-7zhabl4g7ue.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\",\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]]],\"S\":true,\"h\":null,\"s\":\"$undefined\",\"l\":\"$undefined\",\"p\":\"$undefined\",\"d\":\"$undefined\",\"b\":\"CCxR80sZRnjlIdOoXSFK7\"}\ne:[]\n8:\"$We\"\nf:I[22016,[\"/_next/static/chunks/01xlw8hd842-c.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0xv9uz7g8af6d.js\"],\"\"]\n10:I[16505,[\"/_next/static/chunks/01xlw8hd842-c.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0xv9uz7g8af6d.js\"],\"LessonClient\"]\n11:Ta54,# PSSessions and Remoting\n\nPowerShell Remoting lets you run commands on remote computers as if you were sitting at their console. It uses the WS-Management (WinRM) protocol on Windows and SSH on cross-platform setups.\n\n## Enabling Remoting\n\nBefore you can connect to a remote machine, remoting must be enabled on it:\n\n```powershell\nEnable-PSRemoting -Force\n```\n\nThis configures the WinRM service, creates a listener, and sets firewall rules. It requires administrator privileges on the target machine.\n\n> **Key Concept:** On Windows Server, PSRemoting is enabled by default. On client editions of Windows, you must run `Enable-PSRemoting` manually.\n\n## Interactive Sessions with Enter-PSSession\n\n`Enter-PSSession` opens a one-to-one interactive session on a remote computer. Your prompt changes to show the remote machine name:\n\n```powershell\nEnter-PSSession -ComputerName Server01\n[Server01]: PS C:\\> Get-Service | Where-Object Status -eq 'Running'\n[Server01]: PS C:\\> Exit-PSSession\n```\n\n## One-Off Commands with Invoke-Command\n\n`Invoke-Command` runs a script block on one or more remote computers without entering an interactive session:\n\n```powershell\nInvoke-Command -ComputerName Server01, Server02 -ScriptBlock {\n    Get-Process | Sort-Object CPU -Descending | Select-Object -First 5\n}\n```\n\nResults automatically include a `PSComputerName` property so you can tell which machine each result came from.\n\n## Persistent Sessions with New-PSSession\n\nWhen you need to run multiple commands that share state (variables, imported modules), create a persistent session with `New-PSSession`:\n\n```powershell\n$session = New-PSSession -ComputerName Server01\n\nInvoke-Command -Session $session -ScriptBlock { $data = Get-Service }\nInvoke-Command -Session $session -ScriptBlock { $data.Count }\n\nRemove-PSSession $session\n```\n\n> **Key Concept:** Temporary connections (via `-ComputerName`) create and destroy a session for each command. Persistent sessions (via `New-PSSession`) keep state between calls. Always clean up with `Remove-PSSession`.\n\n## Using Credentials\n\nWhen connecting to machines where your current account lacks permissions, provide credentials:\n\n```powershell\n$cred = Get-Credential\n\nEnter-PSSession -ComputerName Server01 -Credential $cred\nInvoke-Command -ComputerName Server01 -Credential $cred -ScriptBlock { hostname }\n```\n\n## Running Local Scripts Remotely\n\nYou can run an entire local script on remote machines without copying the file:\n\n```powershell\nInvoke-Command -ComputerName Server01, Server02 -FilePath C:\\Scripts\\Audit.ps1\n```\n\nPowerShell reads the local file and sends its contents to the remote machines for execution.\n4:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-h-screen bg-zinc-950 text-zinc-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"header\",null,{\"className\":\"sticky top-0 z-10 border-b border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-950/80 backdrop-blur-xl\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto flex max-w-4xl items-center justify-between px-6 py-3.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$Lf\",null,{\"href\":\"/module/intermediate\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-zinc-500 transition-colors hover:text-zinc-300\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-4 w-4\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M10.5 19.5L3 12m0 0l7.5-7.5M3 12h18\"}]}],\"Intermediate PowerShell\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$Lf\",null,{\"href\":\"/module/intermediate/script-structure\",\"className\":\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-zinc-800 text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:border-zinc-700 hover:text-zinc-200\",\"title\":\"Script Structure and Best Practices\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-4 w-4\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M15.75 19.5L8.25 12l7.5-7.5\"}]}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs tabular-nums text-zinc-500\",\"children\":[5,\" / \",6]}],[\"$\",\"$Lf\",null,{\"href\":\"/module/intermediate/credentials-and-securestrings\",\"className\":\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-zinc-800 text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:border-zinc-700 hover:text-zinc-200\",\"title\":\"Credentials and SecureStrings\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-4 w-4\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M8.25 4.5l7.5 7.5-7.5 7.5\"}]}]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 pb-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"PSSessions and Remoting\"}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L10\",null,{\"lesson\":{\"meta\":{\"title\":\"PSSessions and Remoting\",\"description\":\"Remote execution with PowerShell.\",\"slug\":\"pssessions-and-remoting\",\"order\":5,\"prerequisites\":[\"m2-l4\"]},\"content\":\"$11\",\"exercises\":[{\"id\":\"m2-l5-ex1\",\"type\":\"syntax-check\",\"prompt\":\"Write the command to start an interactive remoting session on a computer named 'FileServer01'.\",\"hints\":[\"Use Enter-PSSession to start an interactive session.\",\"Specify the target with -ComputerName.\",\"Try: Enter-PSSession -ComputerName FileServer01\"],\"validation\":[{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"Enter-PSSession\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Use the Enter-PSSession cmdlet.\"},{\"rule\":\"regex\",\"pattern\":\"-ComputerName\\\\s+['\\\"]?FileServer01['\\\"]?\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Specify -ComputerName FileServer01.\"}],\"solution\":\"Enter-PSSession -ComputerName FileServer01\",\"explanation\":\"Enter-PSSession creates an interactive one-to-one session. Commands you type run on the remote computer until you call Exit-PSSession.\"},{\"id\":\"m2-l5-ex2\",\"type\":\"syntax-check\",\"prompt\":\"Write a command that uses Invoke-Command to run 'Get-Service' on two computers named 'Web01' and 'Web02'.\",\"hints\":[\"Use Invoke-Command with -ComputerName and -ScriptBlock.\",\"List multiple computer names separated by commas.\",\"The script block is enclosed in { }.\"],\"validation\":[{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"Invoke-Command\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Use the Invoke-Command cmdlet.\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"-ComputerName\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Specify target computers with -ComputerName.\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"Web01\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Include Web01 in the computer names.\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"Web02\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Include Web02 in the computer names.\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"-ScriptBlock\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Use -ScriptBlock to specify the command to run.\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"Get-Service\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Run Get-Service in the script block.\"}],\"solution\":\"Invoke-Command -ComputerName Web01, Web02 -ScriptBlock { Get-Service }\",\"explanation\":\"Invoke-Command sends the script block to both computers and runs it in parallel. Each result includes a PSComputerName property identifying its source.\"},{\"id\":\"m2-l5-ex3\",\"type\":\"syntax-check\",\"prompt\":\"Write a command that creates a new persistent PSSession to 'DBServer01' and stores it in a variable called $session.\",\"hints\":[\"Use New-PSSession to create a persistent session.\",\"Assign the result to $session.\",\"Specify the computer with -ComputerName.\"],\"validation\":[{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"$$session\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Store the session in a variable called $session.\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"New-PSSession\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Use New-PSSession to create the persistent session.\"},{\"rule\":\"regex\",\"pattern\":\"-ComputerName\\\\s+['\\\"]?DBServer01['\\\"]?\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Specify -ComputerName DBServer01.\"}],\"solution\":\"$$session = New-PSSession -ComputerName DBServer01\",\"explanation\":\"New-PSSession creates a persistent connection. You can reuse $session with Invoke-Command -Session $session for multiple commands that share state.\"},{\"id\":\"m2-l5-ex4\",\"type\":\"syntax-check\",\"prompt\":\"Write a command that uses Invoke-Command with the -Credential parameter. First store credentials in $cred using Get-Credential, then run 'hostname' on 'Server01'.\",\"hints\":[\"First line: $cred = Get-Credential\",\"Second line: Invoke-Command with -ComputerName, -Credential, and -ScriptBlock.\",\"Pass $cred to the -Credential parameter.\"],\"validation\":[{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"Get-Credential\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Use Get-Credential to prompt for credentials.\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"$$cred\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Store the credential in $cred.\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"Invoke-Command\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Use Invoke-Command to run the remote command.\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"-Credential\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Pass credentials with -Credential $cred.\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"hostname\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Run hostname in the script block.\"}],\"solution\":\"$$cred = Get-Credential\\nInvoke-Command -ComputerName Server01 -Credential $cred -ScriptBlock { hostname }\",\"explanation\":\"Get-Credential prompts for a username and password, returning a PSCredential object. The -Credential parameter passes these credentials to authenticate on the remote machine.\"},{\"id\":\"m2-l5-ex5\",\"type\":\"syntax-check\",\"prompt\":\"Write the command to run a local script file 'C:\\\\Scripts\\\\HealthCheck.ps1' on a remote computer named 'ProdServer01' using Invoke-Command.\",\"hints\":[\"Use Invoke-Command with -FilePath instead of -ScriptBlock.\",\"-FilePath specifies a local script to run remotely.\",\"You don't need to copy the file to the remote machine.\"],\"validation\":[{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"Invoke-Command\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Use Invoke-Command.\"},{\"rule\":\"regex\",\"pattern\":\"-ComputerName\\\\s+['\\\"]?ProdServer01['\\\"]?\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Specify -ComputerName ProdServer01.\"},{\"rule\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"-FilePath\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Use -FilePath to specify the local script.\"},{\"rule\":\"regex\",\"pattern\":\"C:\\\\\\\\Scripts\\\\\\\\HealthCheck\\\\.ps1\",\"hintOnFail\":\"Set the file path to C:\\\\Scripts\\\\HealthCheck.ps1.\"}],\"solution\":\"Invoke-Command -ComputerName ProdServer01 -FilePath C:\\\\Scripts\\\\HealthCheck.ps1\",\"explanation\":\"The -FilePath parameter reads a local .ps1 file and sends its contents to the remote computer for execution. This avoids needing to copy scripts to remote machines.\"}],\"moduleSlug\":\"intermediate\"}}],\"$L12\"]}]\n12:[\"$\",\"footer\",null,{\"className\":\"border-t border-zinc-800/60\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto flex max-w-4xl items-center justify-between px-6 py-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$Lf\",null,{\"href\":\"/module/intermediate/script-structure\",\"className\":\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-zinc-400 transition-colors hover:text-zinc-200\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M10.5 19.5L3 12m0 0l7.5-7.5M3 12h18\"}]}],\"Script Structure and Best Practices\"]}],[\"$\",\"$Lf\",null,{\"href\":\"/module/intermediate/credentials-and-securest